1
00:01:39,512 --> 00:01:42,845
放弃吧 我们人比你多
Give up, we've got you outnumbered.

2
00:01:46,554 --> 00:01:47,845
那好吧
All right, then.

3
00:02:25,929 --> 00:02:26,720
什么?
What?

4
00:02:27,595 --> 00:02:28,637
她去哪了?
Where'd she go?

5
00:02:31,429 --> 00:02:32,179
不许动!
Freeze!

6
00:02:32,512 --> 00:02:33,345
我们得跑了!
We gotta move!

7
00:02:54,054 --> 00:02:56,012
你们擎天的精英都一个样!
You Atlas Elites are all the same!

8
00:02:58,304 --> 00:03:01,054
你们以为囤积力量就会永远拥有它
You think hoarding power means you'll have it forever,

9
00:03:01,387 --> 00:03:04,012
但这只会让其他人更加渴望
but it just makes the rest of us hungrier.

10
00:03:08,012 --> 00:03:09,887
而我必须分一杯羹
And I refuse to starve.

11
00:03:48,387 --> 00:03:51,637
我经历了这么多 怎么会被一个玩具拦住
I have come too far to be stopped by some toy.

12
00:04:24,054 --> 00:04:24,970
你在干什么?
What are you doing?

13
00:04:25,012 --> 00:04:26,554
我的生命不重要
My life doesn't matter.

14
00:04:27,345 --> 00:04:29,179
我不同意
I disagree.

15
00:04:33,054 --> 00:04:34,762
快 我们得甩掉他们!
Hurry, we gotta lose them!

16
00:04:54,887 --> 00:04:55,679
朋友们?
Guys?

17
00:04:56,220 --> 00:04:57,470
他们往这儿跑了!
They went this way!

18
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,012
不!
No!

19
00:05:19,804 --> 00:05:20,762
奥斯卡!
Oscar!

20
00:05:24,095 --> 00:05:24,762
站住!
Stop!

21
00:05:37,554 --> 00:05:38,762
放下武器!
Drop your weapons!

22
00:05:40,137 --> 00:05:41,012
撤退!
Fall back!

23
00:05:49,345 --> 00:05:50,304
这边
This way.

24
00:06:04,512 --> 00:06:06,679
你曾经还能享受灿烂的阳光
You had your time in the sun,

25
00:06:08,554 --> 00:06:11,429
但你的日子恐怕已经到头了
but now I'm afraid your time is up.

26
00:06:13,137 --> 00:06:22,095
是的 我觉得我在这里已经等了很久
Yes, I've been waiting here for some time I think.

27
00:06:23,429 --> 00:06:25,762
所以我在等什么?
What was I waiting for?

28
00:06:27,095 --> 00:06:28,304
我
Me.

29
00:06:31,762 --> 00:06:32,262
嗯?
Huh?

30
00:06:32,762 --> 00:06:33,804
不是
No.

31
00:06:37,220 --> 00:06:39,179
我有件事要做
I had a job to do.

32
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:08,970
那是什么
What is that?

33
00:07:10,095 --> 00:07:13,304
那就是完全觉醒的少女的力量
That's the power of a fully realized maiden.

34
00:07:18,054 --> 00:07:20,387
啊 太冷了
Ahh, it's too cold!

35
00:07:20,845 --> 00:07:22,137
我们得做些什么
We have to do something.

36
00:07:27,054 --> 00:07:27,887
Penny!
Penny!

37
00:07:32,554 --> 00:07:34,012
对不起
I'm sorry.

38
00:07:36,679 --> 00:07:37,554
别这样
Don't be.

39
00:07:39,304 --> 00:07:40,804
我们还没有准备好成为猎人
We weren't ready to become Huntsmen.

40
00:07:41,387 --> 00:07:42,970
不是这样的!
That's not true!

41
00:07:43,304 --> 00:07:45,179
那为什么我们没保护好遗物?
Then why aren't we holding the relic?

42
00:07:45,804 --> 00:07:48,220
现在塞伦拿到了神灯 埃隆伍德拿到了神杖
Now Salem has the lamp, Ironwood has the staff,

43
00:07:48,262 --> 00:07:49,970
而我们什么也没有!
and we have nothing!

44
00:07:50,012 --> 00:07:51,637
Ren 够了
Ren, that's enough..

45
00:07:53,804 --> 00:07:56,054
喂 有人吗 听得见吗?
Hello, anybody there, can you hear me?

46
00:07:56,179 --> 00:07:57,762
我们的卷轴?博士!
Our scrolls, Doctor!

47
00:07:57,804 --> 00:08:00,512
哈哈 擎天最热心的人!
Ha ha, finest mind in Atlas!

48
00:08:01,262 --> 00:08:02,970
玛丽亚 你在干什么?
Maria, what are you doing?

49
00:08:03,304 --> 00:08:04,512
开我们用来逃命的船
Grabbing our getaway ship.

50
00:08:04,554 --> 00:08:06,429
我们要赶快离开这里
We need to hightail it out of here.

51
00:08:06,470 --> 00:08:07,220
你们在哪里?
Where are you?

52
00:08:07,262 --> 00:08:08,595
学院的训练室
The academy training room.

53
00:08:08,637 --> 00:08:09,970
我们从一些士兵手中逃走了
We slipped away from some soldiers,

54
00:08:10,012 --> 00:08:11,179
但这不会太久...
but it won't be long before...

55
00:08:11,679 --> 00:08:12,637
他们在这里
They're here.

56
00:08:12,679 --> 00:08:14,595
我们过来了 你们待在一起别动
We're on our way, just stick together.

57
00:08:15,012 --> 00:08:16,762
奥斯卡 奥斯卡?
Oscar, Oscar?

58
00:08:17,512 --> 00:08:19,637
对不起 但是我不会和你们一起走
Sorry, but you all need to go on without me.

59
00:08:19,679 --> 00:08:20,887
你在说什么?
What are you talking about?

60
00:08:21,429 --> 00:08:23,304
有件事我必须单独完成
There's something I have to do alone.

61
00:08:50,929 --> 00:08:52,220
你还好吗?
Are you okay?

62
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:56,470
我有件事要做
I had a job to do.

63
00:08:57,720 --> 00:09:04,637
我要保护好少女的力量 直到我准备好为止
I was supposed to protect the power of the maiden until I was ready.

64
00:09:06,804 --> 00:09:09,845
恐怕我忘记了时间
I worry I may have lost track of time.

65
00:09:10,804 --> 00:09:15,345
但是你可以告诉詹姆斯 我现在准备好了
But you can tell James that I'm ready now.

66
00:09:16,429 --> 00:09:18,762
女士 如果你这么做的话...
Ma'am, if you do that--

67
00:09:18,804 --> 00:09:20,262
我会消失
I'll be gone.

68
00:09:21,679 --> 00:09:27,179
我知道我记性不好 但是这件事还是记得的
I know I have a hard time remembering, but I/remember that.

69
00:09:43,137 --> 00:09:44,970
你叫什么
What's your name?

70
00:09:46,179 --> 00:09:48,012
Penny 女士
It's Penny, ma'am.

71
00:09:52,012 --> 00:09:52,970
Penny
Penny.

72
00:09:54,595 --> 00:09:56,970
你就是那个人吗?
Are you the one?

73
00:10:05,262 --> 00:10:06,262
我..
I..

74
00:10:17,429 --> 00:10:21,512
温特 谢谢 我知道这很困难
Winter, thank you, I know that must have been difficult.

75
00:10:22,262 --> 00:10:24,554
对.. 对不起
I-- I'm so sorry

76
00:10:37,470 --> 00:10:41,304
所以 我有幸在和谁说话?
And whom do I have the pleasure of speaking with?

77
00:10:42,095 --> 00:10:43,387
还是只有我
Still just me.

78
00:10:46,304 --> 00:10:49,012
你很聪明 没把神灯带下来
It was smart of you not to bring the lamp down here.

79
00:10:49,929 --> 00:10:52,012
现在连我也不会相信我自己
I wouldn't trust me either right now.

80
00:10:52,595 --> 00:10:55,220
信任 就是我想来修正的东西
Trust is what I'm hoping to fix.

81
00:10:55,637 --> 00:10:59,637
我知道我们可以共度难关 我们一起
I know we can still figure this out, all of it, together.

82
00:11:01,887 --> 00:11:02,720
请你一起
Please.

83
00:11:04,595 --> 00:11:06,345
你想和我战斗吗?
Do you intend to fight me?

84
00:11:07,554 --> 00:11:10,637
不 这是她想要的
No, that's exactly what she wants.

85
00:11:12,095 --> 00:11:13,762
我想可能是因为奥兹
I guess it's because of Oz

86
00:11:13,804 --> 00:11:18,137
拿着它能让我在害怕时冷静下来
but holding it helps calm me down when I'm afraid.

87
00:11:21,762 --> 00:11:23,470
你仍然觉得我在害怕?
You still think I'm afraid?

88
00:11:23,804 --> 00:11:27,345
我们都一样 我们在恐惧时所做的事会揭露
We all are, it's what we do in our fear that reveals--

89
00:11:27,387 --> 00:11:29,220
你说得倒是轻松!
That's easy for you to say!

90
00:11:30,929 --> 00:11:32,804
随便你怎么看我
You can label me whatever you'd like,

91
00:11:33,304 --> 00:11:36,220
但事实证明了我是对的!
but the fact of the matter is I was right!

92
00:11:37,054 --> 00:11:39,637
在我放下戒备变得柔软的那一刻
The minute I softened, let my guard down,

93
00:11:39,679 --> 00:11:41,095
塞伦就入侵了
that's when Salem had her open.

94
00:11:41,137 --> 00:11:45,304
你如果抛弃曼特城 就等于抛弃了我们让世界重新团结的希望
If you abandon Mantle, you abandon our best chance of reuniting the world.

95
00:11:45,345 --> 00:11:48,262
你拋弃树不子 让千百万人民自生自灭
You abandon Remnant, leaving millions to fend for themselves

96
00:11:48,304 --> 00:11:49,720
以此来拯救少数人 这是什么
so a few can survive, what kind of--

97
00:11:49,762 --> 00:11:53,762
如果塞伦赢了 这些好听的哲理不过是空中楼阁
All excellent philosophical points that won't matter if Salem wins.

98
00:11:53,804 --> 00:11:54,637
听我说!
Listen to me!

99
00:11:54,679 --> 00:11:56,012
不 你听我说!
No, you listen!

100
00:11:56,054 --> 00:11:59,720
我不会再让他人的浅薄的视野
I am done letting others inability to see the big picture

101
00:11:59,762 --> 00:12:01,845
阻碍我去做正确的事
get in the way of doing what's right.

102
00:12:02,720 --> 00:12:08,304
罗宾 议会 这个王国 甚至是你
Robyn, the council, this kingdom, even you.

103
00:12:09,595 --> 00:12:12,054
那你就与她一样危险了 詹姆斯
Then you're as dangerous as she is, James.

104
00:12:14,220 --> 00:12:16,470
詹姆斯是我朋友的叫法
James is what my friends call me.

105
00:12:17,845 --> 00:12:20,512
对于你来说 我是将军
To you, it's General.

106
00:12:31,262 --> 00:12:34,554
我
I...

107
00:12:40,595 --> 00:12:41,929
她是我的!
She's mine!

108
00:12:52,179 --> 00:12:52,762
不
No.

109
00:13:58,762 --> 00:13:59,845
温特!
Winter!

110
00:14:22,845 --> 00:14:26,637
这个星球上所有生物都共有的一种特性
The single quality that is common across every living creature on this planet

111
00:14:27,095 --> 00:14:27,970
便是恐惧
is fear.

112
00:14:38,845 --> 00:14:39,929
温特
Winter.

113
00:14:43,095 --> 00:14:45,720
你做了什么?
What did you do?

114
00:14:47,137 --> 00:14:50,179
有趣的是 即使恐惧如此常见
It's funny then, that as common as fear is

115
00:14:51,387 --> 00:14:54,387
我们却总轻易小看它的力量
we so easily underestimate its power.

116
00:15:01,929 --> 00:15:04,554
Penny 你还好吗?发生了什么?
Are you all right? Penny, what happened?

117
00:15:05,387 --> 00:15:06,429
她
She's...

118
00:15:07,054 --> 00:15:08,095
她走了
..gone.

119
00:15:09,429 --> 00:15:09,970
不
No.

120
00:15:13,137 --> 00:15:15,137
她现在是你的一部分了
She's a part of you now.

121
00:15:17,429 --> 00:15:19,595
怕与人变得亲近
Fear of growing close to someone,

122
00:15:21,679 --> 00:15:23,762
这之后则害怕失去
a subsequent fear of loss.

123
00:15:26,012 --> 00:15:27,804
害怕失败
Fear of failure.

124
00:15:39,804 --> 00:15:43,137
奥斯卡和圣物呢?
Where's Oscar, and the relic?

125
00:15:43,637 --> 00:15:45,762
当更多的人依赖你时
And as more people depend on you,

126
00:15:46,595 --> 00:15:49,179
那些恐惧会变得更加强大
those fears can take on greater power.

127
00:16:02,262 --> 00:16:05,970
但我们无须顾虑恐惧本身
But fear itself isn't worthy of concern.

128
00:16:13,554 --> 00:16:17,012
而是当恐惧降临时 我们会变成什么样的人
It is who we become while in its clutches.

129
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:26,554
我建议你们投降并听从将军的指示
I suggest you all surrender and comply with the General's orders.

130
00:16:28,429 --> 00:16:30,054
我们不能那么做
We can't do that.

131
00:16:31,554 --> 00:16:35,137
那么 我建议你们快跑
Then, I suggest you run.

132
00:16:35,470 --> 00:16:38,304
不 你受伤了 我不能就这样丢下你
No, you're hurt, I'm not going to leave you like this.

133
00:16:38,345 --> 00:16:40,054
你没有丢下我
You're not leaving me.

134
00:16:40,595 --> 00:16:43,679
我只是先让你一步
I'm giving you a head start.

135
00:16:44,720 --> 00:16:46,637
这里是雪倪特工
This is Special Operative Schnee

136
00:16:46,679 --> 00:16:48,845
需要即刻医疗援助
in need of immediate medical assistance.

137
00:16:49,804 --> 00:16:53,429
请求支援 结束
Send reinforcements, over.

138
00:16:57,637 --> 00:16:59,970
我们都需要找到自己的路
We all have to carve our own way.

139
00:17:02,929 --> 00:17:04,595
各位 你们
Guys you're...

140
00:17:05,804 --> 00:17:07,054
我们得走了
We need to go.

141
00:17:16,012 --> 00:17:18,720
那时的那个人值得你骄傲吗?
Will you be proud of that person?

142
00:17:23,470 --> 00:17:25,304
你会原谅那个人吗?
Will you forgive them?

143
00:17:28,554 --> 00:17:33,929
你会理解那人那时为何想要如此行动吗?
Will you understand why they felt the need to do the things they did?

144
00:17:42,762 --> 00:17:44,720
你还能认出那个人吗?
Will you even recognize them?

145
00:17:45,929 --> 00:17:48,220
或者 与那人与你的对视
Or will the person staring back at you

146
00:17:48,262 --> 00:17:51,387
才是你从一开始就该惧怕的?
be the very thing you should have feared from the start?

147
00:17:54,512 --> 00:17:58,679
我想我们迟早都会知道的
I suppose we all find out sooner or later.

148
00:18:14,554 --> 00:18:19,262
那个力量 这些回忆 你回来了 是吗?
That power, these memories, you're back aren't you?

149
00:18:19,929 --> 00:18:20,970
你救了我
You saved me.

150
00:18:21,637 --> 00:18:24,429
其实是你救了我们
Actually you saved us.

151
00:18:28,012 --> 00:18:29,220
奥斯卡 我
Oscar, I--

152
00:18:29,262 --> 00:18:34,137
别说了 我现在只想知道 下一步要如何拯救擎天
Stop, all I want to know is how we save Atlas next.

153
00:18:43,512 --> 00:18:45,595
雷达扫描到了大量敌军
We've got multiple hostiles on radar.

154
00:18:45,637 --> 00:18:47,137
大家都看到了吗?
Is anyone else seeing this?

155
00:18:47,179 --> 00:18:49,429
这些数据不可能是正确的
These readings can't be right.